  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Recruitment and Mission Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Personalf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning till internationella insatser</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) rekryterar, f&#xf6;rbereder,  s&#xe4;nder och st&#xf6;djer civil personal till internationella fredsinsatser som Sverige deltar i, fr&#xe4;mst insatser som leds av EU, FN eller OSSE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) recruits, prepares, deploys and supports civilian experts to international peace operations which Sweden contributes personnel to. The operations are mostly led by the UN, EU and OSCE.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FBA:s personalbidrag till internationella civila krishanteringsinsatser ska enligt Resultatstrategin f&#xf6;r internationell civil krishantering bidra till att uppfylla de m&#xe5;l som respektive organisation har satt upp f&#xf6;r sina insatser. I linje med myndigheten</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In accordance with the Result Strategy for International Crisis Management, FBA&apos;s contribution of personnel to international civil crisis management operations shall contribute to achieving the goals which each organisation has set for their operations. I</narrative>
  </description>
